and personal use of the software while reserving commercial use for a
separate licence from the author.

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 on the curated dataset keeps academic reuse open
(researchers, NGOs, practitioners may use, share and build on it) while
preventing third-party commercial exploitation of the curation work.

